From 92374cfd602d56fa697a6c7813668ee59bfd7605 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Sungsu Ahn <sungsu_ahn@korea.ac.kr>
Date: Wed, 14 Oct 2026 22:20:32 +0900
Subject: [PATCH 03/51] port: node identity from config instead of NUMA logical
 nodes

- Megalon yaml gains node_id (MEGALON_NODE_ID overrides), region_config,
  reinit, attach_mprotect, stuck_timeout_ms, log_sync_interval_us (<=100),
  attach/start-barrier timeouts and nr_log_size; logical_scr_size is now
  required (its default differs per flavor) [V9].
- TidToRid/RidToNumaNode return node_id; Register maps every thread of the
  process to node_id and does not pin; wmeta manager does not pin.
- NUMA checks removed (helper.cc pinThreadtoNumaNode CHECK).
- config/destijl-2vm.yaml: sample per-node config.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 config/destijl-2vm.yaml      | 29 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 lib/globals.cc               | 11 ++++++-----
 src/common/config.cc         | 38 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++--
 src/common/config.h          | 29 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 src/common/helper.cc         | 28 ++++++++++++++++----------
 src/common/helper.h          |  5 +++++
 src/manager/wmeta_manager.cc |  6 +++---
